{
 "name": "Luxurious Locomotive — \"Crew 1. Activate only once each turn.\" is Crew",
 "notes": "Memory: project_audit_crew_saddle_2026-11-11. extractActivatedAbilities read only a bare \"Crew N\" / \"Saddle N\" line, so Luxurious Locomotive's \"Crew 1. Activate only once each turn.\" was no ability at all (no colon) and the Vehicle could not be crewed. It is Crew 1 with an activation limit of one: fired, the Vehicle is a 6/5 artifact creature with the Crewed trait (CR 702.122a), and only the Vehicle changes. The harness fire step crews as fireActivatedAbility does (applyCrew).",
 "recipe": {
  "steps": [
   {
    "add": "Luxurious Locomotive",
    "as": "loco"
   },
   {
    "add": "Grizzly Bears",
    "as": "bears"
   },
   {
    "fire": "@loco",
    "activated": 1,
    "as": "crewed"
   }
  ]
 },
